      "mergeID": "64e4ca90966ec609a2769896",
      "mergedPostDetails": "When settings your safety settings with any/every ranking to have audio off for avatars the avatars continue to have audio.\nThis gets incredibly annoying when a bunch of avatars with loud global audio join and blast your eardrums.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Safety settings not applying to audio",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "60420f68d2bafe1e28ab7c7e",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This still happens! Even when you have Audio on for friends only.\n\nIt also seems that audio playing from contacts will occasionaly get ignored. It could be a animation or animator setting that allows to have the audio still played to you even though you turned audio off in safety.",
