      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The Safety System does not audio from animations nor from contacts into consideration.\n\nBefore the big update, i did not hear any audio from custom animations of other users. I have animations on to see the facial changes through gestures wich is beeing blocked as soon as animations are turned off.\n\nI have avatar audio turned off for anyone besides friend or users i chosen to show all of their avatars. But audio triggered from contacts bypasses the audio toggle, just like spawn in sounds did before.",
